          }
        },
        "question_XxhJbE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I wash my Teddy BODY?",
            "answer": "<p>To avoid stress on the seams, it is important to wash your Nodpod BODY with other soft items, like sheets. Ideally machine wash cold on a delicate cycle inside a garment bag.</p><p>Do not tumble dry — air dry only to maintain fur softness.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_i8bqkV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes this different from a full size weighted blanket?",
            "answer": "<p>You do not need a full size weighted blanket in order to received the benefits of Deep Touch Pressure. Nodpod BODY's design offers concentrated weight to hug the areas that need it most.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_zEgEC6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is Nodpod BODY filled with?",
            "answer": "<p>Nodpod BODY is filled with small, sand-like glass beads.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_Yntnwj": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can my small child use my Teddy BODY?",
            "answer": "<p>No, we do not recommend small children using Nodpod BODY as the concentrated weighted could pose a suffocation hazard.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_KpEDhK": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I Microwave my Nodpod BODY?",
            "answer": "<p>No. You can not microwave your Nodpod BODY.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_pDRR3g": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it TSA approved?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes!</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_Fk8MLd": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the beads in Nodpod BODY made of? Are they safe?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, they are safe. The beads are smooth, round, sand-like glass beads.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_tRFWmR": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who should not use a weighted blanket?",
            "answer": "<p>Using a weighted blanket may not be suitable for individuals who have difficulty removing it from their body due to its weight. Furthermore, people with certain medical conditions such as sleep apnea, breathing difficulties like asthma, sleep disorders, or claustrophobia, should either refrain from using a weighted blanket or consult with a physician before doing so.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_FBQHe7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do your materials contain dangerous chemicals?",
            "answer": "<p>All of Nodpod's materials meet and exceed the most stringent state and federal agencies' guidelines for safe materials.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_H4FHCA": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does 3-minute magic mean I'll be asleep in 3 minutes?",
            "answer": "<p>Most people describe a feeling of relaxation, which is attributed to the science of Deep Touch Pressure within minutes. Not everyone experiences the same feeling as quickly. If you are not fully satisfied with your Nodpod we would be happy to refund you. </p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        }
      },
